<view class="page feature-page aftercare-page"><brand-header back="{{true}}" title="术后护理"></brand-header><view class="pad"><view class="care-overview panel"><view class="between"><view><view class="section-title">用心记录，安心陪伴</view><view class="card-note">{{date}} · 今日护理</view></view><view class="care-overview-icon"><ui-icon name="care" size="48"></ui-icon></view></view><view class="care-progress-copy">已完成 <text>{{completed}}/3</text> 项今日记录</view><view class="care-progress-track"><view style="width:{{completed * 100 / 3}}%"></view></view></view><view class="feature-panel panel"><view class="between"><text class="section-title">今日护理清单</text><button class="more" bindtap="instructions">护理须知<ui-icon name="chevron" size="22"></ui-icon></button></view><button class="care-task" wx:for="{{tasks}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggle"><view class="care-checkbox {{item.checked ? 'checked' : ''}}"><ui-icon wx:if="{{item.checked}}" name="check" active="{{true}}" size="28"></ui-icon></view><view><view class="care-task-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="card-note">{{item.description}}</view></view></button></view><view class="feature-panel panel"><view class="section-title">今日护理备注</view><textarea class="care-note-input" value="{{note}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="300" placeholder="写下今日护理备注，仅保存在当前设备"></textarea><button class="secondary-button care-save" bindtap="save">保存护理记录</button></view><view class="feature-panel panel" wx:if="{{records.length}}"><view class="section-title">近期护理记录</view><view class="care-note-record" wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id"><text>{{item.date}}</text><view>{{item.note}}</view></view></view><view class="notice">此页为护理记录框架，不提供具体医疗护理方案。护理说明与复诊安排请以机构提供的个性化指引为准。</view></view><view class="bottom-action"><button class="primary-button" bindtap="book">预约复诊咨询</button></view></view>
